\" data-end=\"813\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"813\" class=\"\">Transmission Distance: Up to 550 meters</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"845\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"845\" class=\"\">Hot-pluggable SFP form factor</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"890\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"890\" class=\"\">Low power consumption and high reliability</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"940\" class=\"\">Compatible with a wide range of network devices</li><li data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"940\" class=\"\">1-Year Warranty</li><li data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"940\" class=\"\"><p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"940\" class=\"\">Made in China</p></li></ul></ul>\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1105\" class=\"\">Optimize your short-range fiber connectivity with the <strong data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1038\">D CORE 1.25G 850nm LC Duplex SFP Module</strong>, engineered for stable, efficient, and cost-effective performance.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","now":"2,500৳","old":"3,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba 40G QSFP+ LC BiDi 150m MMF SFP Module","href":"/hpe-aruba-40g-qsfp-lc-bidi-150m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"7,000৳","old":"8,000৳","sing